<br/>
<br/>Wow! Thank you for the 10 and your very kind comment. Just lucky to be at the right place at the right time. I had been hoping a hummer would show up at this flower as it stood above a patch of wildflowers I had planted. I had been periodically looking at it and know the hummers are most hungry in the morning. The sun was coming up and cast the perfect light on the backround. The bee was a bonus!</td>', 'Originally posted by Barroness: I still can''t get over the beauty of this image. I was one of your 10''s. You are an amazing photographer. The depth and beauty of this image is beyond my imagination. I hope you print it, frame it and look at it often. 

Wow! Thank you for the 10 and your very kind comment. Just lucky to be at the right place at the right time. I had been hoping a hummer would show up at this flower as it stood above a patch of wildflowers I had planted. I had been periodically looking at it and know the hummers are most hungry in the morning. The sun was coming up and cast the perfect light on the backround. The bee was a bonus!', '2024-08-12 19:08:37.000000', NULL, 0);
